title: "Workloop Spec: Agentic Workloop Specification"
abstract: "Specification for agentic workloops: systems of two or more agentic loops that interact through explicit channels under one policy authority, where no inter-loop interaction and no externally effecting action occurs without passing through a deterministic gate that enforces that authority's policies and business rules. Defines terms, invariant, corollaries, operational requirements, and conformance. Portuguese (Brazil) translation is included as a secondary language."
